lance<break/>Time (n)<xref rid="t2fn2" ref-type="table-fn">†</xref></th><th align="center" valign="bottom" content-type="entry xxxx-borders" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th align="center" valign="bottom" content-type="entry xxxr-borders" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr></thead><tbody content-type="tbody"><tr content-type="row"><td align="left" valign="top" content-type="entry xxlx-borders hanging01 shading" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" valign="top" colspan="2" content-type="entry xxxx-borders shading" rowspan="1">
<bold>(N=18,198)</bold>
