d for the surveillance time.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="t3" orientation="portrait"><label>Table 3</label><caption><title>Vaccine Efficacy Overall and by Subgroup in Participants without Evidence of Infection before 7 Days after Dose 2.</title></caption><alternatives><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" position="float" orientation="portrait" xlink:href="NEJMoa2034577_t3.jpg"><?image-name NEJMoa2034577_t3.jpg?><?image-size 149341?><?image-md5 f68df922e98b738b3dee98bd93545f69?><?image-image-server-status LOAD_COMPLETED?><?image-original-height 1689?><?image-original-width 1999?><?image-scaled-height 675?><?image-scaled-width 799?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/e913/7745181/f68df922e98b/NEJMoa2034577_t3.jpg?><?thumb-name NEJMoa2034577_t3.gif?><?thumb-size 3891?><?thumb-md5 868d744a438845c3d0c546b5b937854b?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 84?><?thumb-scaled-width 100?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/e913/7745181/868d744a4388/NEJMoa2034577_t3.gif?></graphic><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" content-type="tgroup"><colgroup span="1"><col id="t3col1" width="19.66%" span="1"/><col id="t3col2" width="10.68%" span="1"/><col id="t3col3" width="11.17%" span="1"/><col id="t3col4" width="12.55%" span="1"/><col id="t3col5" width="14.45%" span="1"/><col id="t3col6" width="14.85%" span="1"/></colgroup><thead content-type="thead sticky"><tr content-type="row head1"><th align="left" valign="bottom" content-type="entry txlx-borders" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Efficacy End-Point<break/> Subgroup</th><th align="center" valign="bottom" colspan="2" content-type="entry txxx-borders" rowspan="1">BNT162b2<break/>(N=18,198)</th><th align="center" valign="bottom" colspan="2" content-type="entry txxx-borders" rowspan="1">Placebo<break/>(N=18,325)</th><th align="center" valign="bottom" content-type="entry txxr-borders" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Vaccine Efficacy, %<break/> (95% CI)<xref rid="t3fn2" ref-ty